/* ── Hardware reset ─────────────────────────────────────────────────── *
 *  SX1278 datasheet: pull RST LOW for ≥ 100 µs, then release HIGH.    *
 *  PB6 (LORA_STATUS_Pin) is initialised LOW by MX_GPIO_Init, so the   *
 *  module is already in reset at startup. Assert → hold → release.     */
